title: "Canon EOS R1 firmware research: card boot, burst throttle, AF detection rate, 6K OpenGate"
abstract: "An independent security/interoperability research record for the Canon EOS R1 (firmware 1.3.0): boot chain, USB factory channel, page-table remapping, burst-throttle behaviour, AF detection rate, and the 6K OpenGate failure path. Documentation only; no firmware, keys, payloads or tools."
